    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「月ちゃん先輩に預けたんが、間違いやったかなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「チア衣装はお腹冷えてまうし、体操着は持ってきてへんから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「こうやって余ってたアイドルの衣装を借りてきたわけやけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「コスプレ大会やないんやから、もっとちゃんとした服がよかったわぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「しかもゆうちゃんが『遅れてきた罰ですよ～♪』って言い出して、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「アイドル衣装で家に帰ることになってもうたし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「あ、あれ、転校生くん……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「なんでおるん!?　うち、こないな恥ずかしい服着てるの見られたくなかったわぁ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「……というか『大歓迎会』はええのん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「ああ、そうなんや。もう『おひらき』になったから、戻ってきたんやね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "（ち、沈黙が気まずいわぁ……！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "（言いたいことは、さっきの『歓迎の言葉』で言ってもうたし……）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "（あ、そういえば……）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「……あ、あの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「そ、そういや転校生くん……こないだ、屋上でうちに、質問したやろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「転校生くんが君咲学院に来てから、何か変わったか……って質問」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「あれなぁ、うち、思ったんやけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「『大歓迎会』の盛り上がりは、もちろん、協力してくれたみんなが作ったものやけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「転校生くんがおらへんかったら、きっとなかったはずやから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「それって、立派な変化やと思うんよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「ほやけど……転校していくかどうかのとこまで、思いつめんでもよかったのになぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「うちや、うち以外にも、たくさんの生徒たちが引き留めたのに、なんにも相談してくれんのやから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「……ほぇ？　前の質問と転校していくかどうかって、関係あらへんかったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「ああ……テスト範囲が広すぎて困惑してたんや？　それで落ち込んでて……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「うん。君咲学院はいちおう、お嬢様学校やからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「むかし……転校生くんが来る前から、テストは難しかったみたいなんよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「もっとも、さいきんはいちぶの生徒しか解けへんような問題も出るらしいけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「うちもけっこう、テストには苦戦したんよね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「で、それとは関係のないときに転校の話が出てきた、ってことなんやね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-idol",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-idol_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "こよい",
    "text": "「それじゃ、うちの答えは、転校生くんの悩みとは関係なかったってこと……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
